<% frontend_base = ENV.fetch('FRONTEND_URL', root_url).chomp('/') %>
Choose a new Nexus Hub password:
<%= "#{frontend_base}/reset-password?token=#{CGI.escape(@token)}&email=#{CGI.escape(@resource.email)}" %>

This link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, Devise.reset_password_within) %>.
If you did not request this, ignore this email. Your password will not change until you choose a new one.
